WEBVTT

00:01.230 --> 00:03.940
I intended to carefully
consider what the informant said...

00:03.940 --> 00:06.900
and investigate one step at a time.

00:06.900 --> 00:08.910
But that demon lady...

00:09.260 --> 00:11.870
She used threats,
deception, and seduction.

00:11.870 --> 00:14.910
It seemed she didn't care about
keeping the investigation a secret.

00:15.450 --> 00:18.710
You're still
very critical of Rona's actions.

00:18.710 --> 00:20.420
I wish you two could
be hotpot buddies.

00:20.830 --> 00:25.380
I will never have a hotpot
with someone as loathsome as her!

00:25.380 --> 00:27.880
She can't be trusted!

00:28.510 --> 00:31.870
She's not that bad
when it comes to delivering results.

00:31.870 --> 00:34.720
It only took her a few days
to track down those who were involved.

00:35.010 --> 00:38.770
I get it now. Incompetence is
more likeble than depravity.

00:38.770 --> 00:41.520
I need some bananas to
quench this displeasure.

00:41.520 --> 00:43.690
And the way she dresses...

00:43.690 --> 00:45.650
Shameless exhibitionist!

00:46.000 --> 00:49.360
Things took an unexpected turn.

00:49.360 --> 00:51.280
People can't trust each other anymore.

00:51.280 --> 00:53.870
No, it's more like
we can't trust the humans.

00:54.530 --> 00:55.540
In any case,

00:55.540 --> 00:58.080
I'll discuss our course
of action with Rona.

00:58.390 --> 01:00.710
I hate the hot-headed kind.

01:00.710 --> 01:03.420
She doesn't understand
the wonder of hotpot!

01:03.420 --> 01:06.380
She doesn't know sexiness is not measured by
how much she exposes!

01:06.380 --> 01:08.950
Nor does she appreciate
the prestige of bananas!

01:29.610 --> 01:35.530
TSUKIMICHI -MOONLIT FANTASY- SEASON 2

02:40.310 --> 02:41.970
NIGHT 10: TIME FOR REFORMATION

02:41.970 --> 02:42.930
Dropping out?

02:42.930 --> 02:43.480
Yes.

02:43.980 --> 02:46.480
I've accomplished my goal.

02:46.480 --> 02:48.060
It's time to leave this city.

02:49.020 --> 02:51.610
You'll have to deal with
the organisation from here on.

02:51.610 --> 02:53.490
So Karen Fors is...

02:54.070 --> 02:56.950
Sorry you're losing a student.

02:57.530 --> 03:00.980
The school will likely receive word
of her passing this summer break.

03:01.450 --> 03:03.750
Using death as an excuse
seems a bit too much.

03:04.370 --> 03:06.500
It'll be shocking news to the students.

03:06.500 --> 03:08.460
We'll even have to explain to her family.

03:09.090 --> 03:10.620
So be it.

03:11.250 --> 03:14.170
But in the records of Foosk Royal Academy,
she is dead.

03:14.760 --> 03:15.930
Thanks for the help.

03:15.930 --> 03:21.010
Your spies value ethics and morality.
Those are good qualities.

03:21.430 --> 03:23.220
But in the world of covert operations,

03:23.220 --> 03:26.020
less reasonable methods
are sometimes necessary.

03:26.560 --> 03:28.590
Thanks for the advice.

03:29.110 --> 03:31.980
You don't discriminate
against demi-humans and demons.

03:32.320 --> 03:33.510
Honestly,

03:33.510 --> 03:36.820
you are the most outstanding human
I've ever met.

03:36.820 --> 03:40.030
So much so that I'd love
to bring you to the Demon King.

03:40.030 --> 03:42.580
I'm happy you think so.

03:43.120 --> 03:46.370
A last piece of personal advice.

03:48.250 --> 03:50.970
You should cast away
the demi-humans with brown skin

03:51.590 --> 03:53.270
and your servant, Shiki.

03:54.380 --> 03:55.840
What do you mean?

03:57.680 --> 03:59.760
Perhaps you haven't heard.

03:59.760 --> 04:02.730
Those two were violent demi-humans
known as the Forest Ogres.

04:02.730 --> 04:04.020
I'm aware of that.

04:04.470 --> 04:06.310
Given their combat strength,

04:06.310 --> 04:09.520
some have suggested recruiting them
for the Demon King's forces.

04:09.520 --> 04:12.770
However, they refuse to serve other races.

04:13.110 --> 04:15.740
Those two will betray you eventually.

04:15.740 --> 04:18.779
She has a point.
If I don't give them bananas...

04:19.089 --> 04:22.029
Without bananas,
there's no motivation to work!

04:22.029 --> 04:24.040
No bananas, no life.

04:24.330 --> 04:25.750
As for Shiki,

04:26.250 --> 04:28.410
he is possessed.

04:28.410 --> 04:31.670
Not by a human or a demon,
but a lich.

04:31.670 --> 04:33.960
He's not possessed.
That's just what he is.

04:34.710 --> 04:37.540
The demons called them the Larvas.

04:38.300 --> 04:41.220
They were once our allies
and enemies at one point.

04:41.220 --> 04:45.180
One thing I know for sure is
that they can't be trusted.

04:45.560 --> 04:48.310
- Shiki and Rona could be a match.
- One and two...

04:48.310 --> 04:50.520
- They both said the same thing.
- One and two...

04:50.940 --> 04:54.110
Kuzunoha, you should be wary of them.

04:54.980 --> 04:58.990
If you need a favor from the demons,

04:59.700 --> 05:02.350
use this to communicate
with me telepathically.

05:03.660 --> 05:06.370
I'll help out however I can.

05:07.660 --> 05:09.660
Is this...

05:13.080 --> 05:15.550
KUZUNOHA

05:15.550 --> 05:16.800
This incantation...

05:17.550 --> 05:22.930
...could be connected to the cursed item
that hindered the goddess' protection.

05:22.930 --> 05:24.010
I knew it.

05:24.350 --> 05:25.500
Young Master,

05:25.500 --> 05:29.980
the demon general named Rona could
very likely be an excellent strategist.

05:31.020 --> 05:34.980
Perhaps she wants you to have a favorable
impression of the demon generals.

05:35.440 --> 05:36.930
I know that.

05:37.440 --> 05:39.940
As the person in charge of
the company and the subspace,

05:40.440 --> 05:44.040
JUDGMENT AND VIGILANCE
I'll maintain judgment and vigilance.

05:46.080 --> 05:47.910
Hold on.

05:48.490 --> 05:50.410
Raim is a human, right?

05:50.410 --> 05:52.330
How could he talk to me?

05:52.710 --> 05:55.420
Well... About that...

05:55.730 --> 05:58.210
Tomoe, did you...

05:58.210 --> 06:01.300
No. He was very earnest
when he asked...

06:01.300 --> 06:02.880
So I gave him some of my blood.

06:04.680 --> 06:06.680
You made him your servant?

06:06.680 --> 06:09.100
It's too soon for him
to give up being a human!

06:10.140 --> 06:11.980
You are right.

06:11.980 --> 06:13.940
What's done is done.

06:15.060 --> 06:18.690
Anyway, I want to be stricter from now on.

06:19.480 --> 06:21.690
That sounds very reassuring.

06:21.690 --> 06:25.870
Therefore, I want to deal with
the organisation as soon as possible.

06:25.870 --> 06:29.910
I, on the other hand,
want to go for a bigger target.

06:30.240 --> 06:31.210
I thought so.

06:31.950 --> 06:35.170
But this matter doesn't just concern
the academy or the shop.

06:35.170 --> 06:37.670
It concerns Ms. Eva and Ms. Luria as well.

06:37.980 --> 06:40.380
Young Master, how kind of you.

06:40.710 --> 06:42.880
You can count on us...

06:42.880 --> 06:44.130
...to take care of the rest.

06:44.840 --> 06:47.390
No, that is my job.

06:48.010 --> 06:49.260
Ms. Tomoe?

06:50.930 --> 06:53.520
He will change
when the chance presents itself.

06:54.230 --> 06:57.560
Understood.
We will do as the Young Master says.

07:00.070 --> 07:02.570
My subordinates have been reckless.

07:02.990 --> 07:04.230
Sorry about that.

07:04.700 --> 07:07.030
You underestimated me.

07:07.530 --> 07:10.240
I have nothing to write home about,

07:10.240 --> 07:13.000
but I do have a lot of
outstanding subordinates.

07:13.290 --> 07:15.750
I bet you know about the organisation.

07:16.710 --> 07:18.040
Certainly.

07:18.330 --> 07:20.380
I have comrades all over the world.

07:20.380 --> 07:21.920
If you lay a finger on me,

07:21.920 --> 07:23.090
you will regret it!

07:23.630 --> 07:27.800
From what we can tell,
your usefulness has run its course.

07:28.590 --> 07:30.430
They have no intention of rescuing you.

07:30.430 --> 07:32.930
The Assassin Guild
hasn't made a move either.

07:33.350 --> 07:35.640
You even know about
my connection with the guild?

07:36.190 --> 07:39.680
You told me yourself, Mr. Blight.

07:40.270 --> 07:41.820
Was it hypnosis?

07:41.820 --> 07:44.030
I had to use certain methods.

07:45.820 --> 07:47.320
Tell me something.

07:48.200 --> 07:51.340
Why didn't you just do
your job as a teacher?

07:51.870 --> 07:55.200
As a human, you have no reason
to go against the goddess.

07:57.250 --> 08:00.210
There is only one goddess in this world.

08:00.210 --> 08:03.130
She can help and abandon anyone
whenever she pleases.

08:03.130 --> 08:06.170
She has been the cause
of many disputes and conflicts.

08:06.510 --> 08:08.630
The goddess is too wilful.

08:08.630 --> 08:10.430
She doesn't love all humans equally,

08:10.430 --> 08:13.930
much less the demi-humans in this world.

08:13.930 --> 08:18.390
It's only a matter of time
before our organization comes into existence.

08:18.850 --> 08:22.650
I just might get along
with these people.

08:22.650 --> 08:27.030
This accursed goddess is not fit
to rule the world.

08:27.030 --> 08:30.110
The humans can live
just fine without her.

08:30.110 --> 08:32.990
Don't you agree with me, Kuzunoha?

08:34.080 --> 08:38.960
Those wronged by others had to suppress
their own hatred and resentment towards her,

08:39.250 --> 08:41.330
simply because she was the goddess!

08:41.330 --> 08:43.210
That is not right!

08:43.630 --> 08:46.010
Don't you think so, Kuzunoha?

08:46.710 --> 08:48.790
So, how do you explain
the human experiment?

08:48.790 --> 08:51.050
Why drag the demi-humans into this?

08:51.390 --> 08:53.300
Isn't it obvious?

08:53.300 --> 08:56.270
Why should the humans be sacrificed?

08:56.570 --> 09:00.680
It's only natural to sacrifice
the demi-humans instead.

09:01.980 --> 09:04.020
I've heard enough, Mr. Blight.

09:07.320 --> 09:08.190
Farewell.

09:09.240 --> 09:10.290
Stop...

09:11.530 --> 09:13.320
Any plans for this summer break?

09:13.320 --> 09:15.160
I'll probably go home.

09:15.160 --> 09:16.330
Should we go to the beach?

09:16.330 --> 09:17.930
A trip to the lake sounds nice, too.

09:17.930 --> 09:19.580
I have summer classes...

09:21.080 --> 09:23.920
With so many returning home,
it could be a problem.

09:23.920 --> 09:25.210
Father was crying.

09:25.670 --> 09:28.420
He asked why we didn't
go home immediately.

09:28.770 --> 09:30.590
The Rembrandt sisters.

09:30.590 --> 09:33.260
I heard they've become
a lot more friendly lately.

09:33.260 --> 09:35.300
That might not be true.

09:35.300 --> 09:38.020
You know what they did to the girls
who wooed Mr. Kuzunoha?

09:38.560 --> 09:43.020
Are you truly ready
to marry Mr. Kuzunoha?

09:43.020 --> 09:45.770
You must never cheat on him.

09:46.140 --> 09:50.900
I'd hate to see him in the company
of some boring women.

09:50.900 --> 09:53.120
You can relate to that, can't you?

09:54.240 --> 09:56.160
I also heard that Mr. Blight resigned...

09:56.160 --> 09:58.290
...because of those two.

09:58.290 --> 09:59.500
That's not possible.

10:01.330 --> 10:02.580
Ilum!

10:02.580 --> 10:03.540
Are you all right?

10:03.910 --> 10:06.250
You've been in a bad shape recently.

10:07.000 --> 10:08.960
It's nothing.
I am fine.

10:15.240 --> 10:17.350
Darn it! I need more.

10:18.600 --> 10:19.630
I need more.

10:22.890 --> 10:24.980
Have you heard about Karen?

10:25.270 --> 10:27.860
Yes. Very unfortunate.

10:27.860 --> 10:30.530
It's a family matter,
so it can't be helped.

10:30.530 --> 10:31.400
Yeah.

10:31.400 --> 10:34.200
Now that we have one less student,

10:34.200 --> 10:37.450
we hope you two can join the next lesson
for the amusement activity.

10:37.800 --> 10:39.450
Amusement activity?

10:39.450 --> 10:41.160
Well, it's more like interrogation.

10:41.580 --> 10:45.000
Blue Lizard is very strong.

10:45.000 --> 10:47.040
His brute strength is unmatched.

10:47.040 --> 10:49.210
He even dodges as if
he can predict the future.

10:49.800 --> 10:53.150
His maneuvers are unusual
because he has a tail.

10:53.760 --> 10:57.550
Jin, Daena, and I must work together
to look for an opening.

10:58.220 --> 11:01.290
I suspect he can use both
water and wind magic as well.

11:01.290 --> 11:03.810
There was no sign of him
using healing or boosting magic.

11:04.140 --> 11:06.730
Maybe he didn't feel
the need to use it.

11:06.730 --> 11:08.020
Water and wind...

11:08.810 --> 11:12.480
Then perhaps I can join
as your extra firepower.

11:12.850 --> 11:15.860
There are three in the vanguard.
I'll be the archer.

11:16.320 --> 11:19.450
We might as well move
Daena and Mithra to the middle

11:19.450 --> 11:21.120
so they can assist the mage.

11:21.450 --> 11:22.490
Sounds like a plan.

11:23.160 --> 11:25.270
We must utilize both
physical and magic attacks

11:25.270 --> 11:27.580
to come up with a tactic
that will land a hit on him.

11:28.710 --> 11:30.500
Let's give him all we have!

11:30.500 --> 11:31.840
- Yeah!
- All right!

11:32.380 --> 11:35.220
And now, the last lesson
before the summer break.

11:37.130 --> 11:38.220
Huh?

11:38.930 --> 11:39.970
Let me introduce you.

11:39.970 --> 11:41.060
Huh?

11:41.600 --> 11:43.270
This is Blue Lizard from before.

11:43.730 --> 11:44.350
Huh?

11:44.640 --> 11:47.190
And Blue Lizard No.2.

11:49.400 --> 11:50.980
There's another one?

11:51.570 --> 11:55.690
Of course. You will learn nothing
if you are fighting seven-on-one.

11:56.360 --> 11:59.510
Will you all fight them at once
or fight in teams? That's up to you.

11:59.990 --> 12:02.530
I'd like to know more for reference.

12:02.530 --> 12:05.040
Are they equally strong?

12:05.320 --> 12:06.060
Yes.

12:06.500 --> 12:08.790
Blue Lizard specializes in techniques.

12:09.540 --> 12:11.750
Blue Lizard No.2 specializes
in power attacks.

12:18.550 --> 12:21.470
Our meticulous strategy...

12:22.930 --> 12:25.140
It was all a waste of time.

12:25.600 --> 12:28.480
Summer grass in dread.
My green students are living

12:28.480 --> 12:30.230
their short-lived daydreams.

12:32.360 --> 12:34.110
It's summer.

12:34.110 --> 12:35.320
Summer is here.

12:35.940 --> 12:37.240
It's summer break,

12:37.240 --> 12:39.530
but there are still
many enthused students.

12:39.530 --> 12:42.320
To widen the gap of strength.

12:42.320 --> 12:43.780
To catch up to others.

12:43.780 --> 12:46.000
Such are their hopes.

12:46.700 --> 12:49.330
The sisters didn't go home.

12:49.830 --> 12:53.420
Mr. Rembrandt went as far as to ask
for the impossible in his letter.

12:53.420 --> 12:54.800
He wants me to send them home.

12:55.090 --> 12:56.590
Sif has always been well-mannered,

12:56.590 --> 13:00.220
but she got so tired from the lesson
that she lay down with her arms spread.

13:00.220 --> 13:03.760
It's almost time for them
to enter the next stage.

13:04.970 --> 13:06.180
Almost.

13:06.180 --> 13:06.970
Master Kuzunoha?

13:07.980 --> 13:10.890
Sir, do you have a moment?

13:13.620 --> 13:15.350
What is this meeting about?

13:15.900 --> 13:20.030
Can you train us over this summer?

13:20.030 --> 13:23.910
Of course,
we'll pay you for the lessons.

13:24.700 --> 13:26.620
Do all of you agree with this?

13:27.370 --> 13:29.000
Especially you two, Sif and Yuno.

13:29.000 --> 13:31.870
Your family told you to go home.

13:32.420 --> 13:34.920
DETERMINED
We'll be fine being away for half a year.

13:34.920 --> 13:35.790
Please!

13:35.790 --> 13:37.250
DETERMINED
Please!

13:37.800 --> 13:39.920
Wait, if you stay...

13:40.470 --> 13:42.670
Shiki, my schedule is already full.

13:42.670 --> 13:44.890
It should be all right
if it's once a week.

13:45.270 --> 13:48.100
Shiki, that's not the answer I want!

13:48.100 --> 13:49.600
Stares...

13:49.600 --> 13:51.810
The youngsters' eyes are full of hope!

13:52.270 --> 13:55.270
Very well.
We'll do it once a week.

13:55.270 --> 13:57.820
- Yay!
- That's great!

13:57.820 --> 13:59.070
But for Sif and Yuno,

13:59.780 --> 14:02.200
you're going home for
the latter half of summer break.

14:02.200 --> 14:03.660
That's the condition.

14:03.660 --> 14:04.640
What?

14:04.640 --> 14:07.030
But we want to stay here
with everyone!

14:07.030 --> 14:09.290
You had just recovered
from a great illness.

14:09.290 --> 14:12.120
Go home.
Don't make your parents worry.

14:13.420 --> 14:15.050
All right.

14:16.090 --> 14:18.420
He was so concerned for my safety.

14:18.420 --> 14:20.210
It's only right to return the favor.

14:21.300 --> 14:23.050
A reward?

14:23.050 --> 14:26.970
Thanks to you,
I'm out of danger for the time being.

14:27.640 --> 14:30.590
After reclaiming Kaleneon,

14:30.590 --> 14:33.230
I'll give you part of
the Aensland family's land in return.

14:33.770 --> 14:35.040
That won't be necessary.

14:35.040 --> 14:37.480
I don't need such a valuable gift.

14:37.480 --> 14:41.650
But that's the only thing I can offer.

14:42.070 --> 14:44.400
How about you recommend some books?

14:46.030 --> 14:47.870
Recommend a book you like.

14:52.870 --> 14:57.540
I have no choice but to rely
on him and his company.

14:58.420 --> 15:01.450
The book has to be one
that catches his attention.

15:07.010 --> 15:09.180
We did it...

15:09.490 --> 15:11.560
Well done, everybody.

15:11.560 --> 15:14.480
You finally did it
after getting wiped out four times.

15:16.730 --> 15:17.940
Ouch...

15:18.270 --> 15:19.730
For the rest of the lesson,

15:19.730 --> 15:22.690
you may test your strength
against Blue Lizard Version 2.0.

15:24.240 --> 15:25.900
What do you mean by Version 2.0?

15:26.490 --> 15:28.620
Time to check on the others.

15:30.370 --> 15:31.620
A support spell or a buff?

15:32.040 --> 15:33.910
Not on my watch!

15:38.540 --> 15:39.750
Cast a barrier!

15:39.750 --> 15:40.250
Got it.

15:41.940 --> 15:42.420
Ouch...

15:45.380 --> 15:47.550
The surrounding mana is being jammed.

15:47.550 --> 15:48.340
Is this...

15:48.340 --> 15:49.600
Scatter!

16:01.400 --> 16:03.530
Fire of calamity,
converge into an inferno.

16:03.530 --> 16:06.150
Heed my command and unleash yourself.

16:06.150 --> 16:08.410
Sif, let's finish this jerk!

16:10.260 --> 16:10.700
Huh?

16:16.290 --> 16:18.210
A sudden burst of strength.

16:18.210 --> 16:19.250
Huh? Hold on!

16:19.250 --> 16:20.330
Darn you!

16:23.960 --> 16:24.970
Daena!

16:30.510 --> 16:32.600
Inferno Vortex!

16:39.140 --> 16:42.270
Please don't hit my face...

16:48.110 --> 16:49.390
It's my mistake.

16:49.910 --> 16:52.390
It could have led
to an unthinkable disaster.

16:52.390 --> 16:53.450
You have my apologies.

16:53.450 --> 16:55.740
There's no need to apologize.

16:55.740 --> 16:58.710
Please tell us
why he suddenly gets so powerful.

16:58.710 --> 17:00.320
I'd like to know, too.

17:00.960 --> 17:02.920
Was he toying with us before that?

17:03.790 --> 17:08.550
The Blue Lizards' original power
is above lesser dragons.

17:08.550 --> 17:13.180
They only used ten percent of their
strength to match yours in combat.

17:13.520 --> 17:14.680
Just ten percent?

17:14.680 --> 17:15.680
That was ten percent?

17:15.680 --> 17:18.430
But why did he go berserk at the end?

17:19.099 --> 17:22.190
I didn't do a proper introduction.

17:22.650 --> 17:24.359
Blue Lizard No.2 is...

17:24.359 --> 17:25.980
I mean, Ms. Blue Lizard No.2...

17:26.280 --> 17:27.410
...is a girl.

17:27.940 --> 17:29.240
Huh!?

17:29.240 --> 17:32.660
I think she got a bit too upset
when you called her a jerk.

17:34.910 --> 17:36.030
Oh...

17:36.030 --> 17:40.870
Please address her as Ms. No.2
or Ms. Blue Lizard No.2.

17:41.540 --> 17:43.830
If you happen to call her names again...

17:44.200 --> 17:45.670
Mr. Kuzunoha!

17:45.670 --> 17:47.960
Let us have a rematch
with Ms. Blue Lizard No.2.

17:47.960 --> 17:48.800
Please.

17:51.630 --> 17:54.090
Very well.
One last battle.

17:54.090 --> 17:55.010
Yes!

17:56.810 --> 17:58.810
FIVE IRONS
Thanks for the food!

17:59.180 --> 18:01.140
Well then, stay safe on the way home.

18:01.440 --> 18:02.440
Okay.

18:02.440 --> 18:03.670
Bye!

18:03.670 --> 18:04.770
Good night.

18:04.770 --> 18:05.990
- All right.
- I am so full.

18:05.990 --> 18:08.940
Shiki, did you teach them
something behind my back?

18:08.940 --> 18:10.940
You noticed.

18:11.860 --> 18:16.830
I suggested that they battle monsters
to raise their levels.

18:16.830 --> 18:17.580
I see.

18:18.330 --> 18:21.530
Even they are members
of the Adventurers' Guild.

18:22.040 --> 18:23.370
By leveling up,

18:23.370 --> 18:26.210
they can receive the grace
of that pervy guild master.

18:26.880 --> 18:30.760
The speed of their growth
will go up as they level up.

18:31.340 --> 18:35.640
They are probably not the kind
to be blinded by fame and gain.

18:35.640 --> 18:36.890
This is good.

18:36.890 --> 18:37.930
Yes.

18:37.930 --> 18:41.310
Yes. I recommended
a few suitable training grounds to them.

18:41.640 --> 18:44.390
Well done, Shiki.
You've been of great help.

18:44.390 --> 18:47.230
But just to be sure...

18:48.610 --> 18:50.860
Are there any bananas left in the shop?

18:56.990 --> 18:58.830
This is incredible.

18:58.830 --> 19:00.990
My level increased by eight

19:00.990 --> 19:03.660
in less than a day.

19:03.660 --> 19:05.710
All thanks to Mr. Kuzunoha's lessons.

19:06.090 --> 19:08.210
Don't forget about Mr. Shiki's help.

19:08.210 --> 19:09.880
Without him,

19:09.880 --> 19:12.130
we'd be dead for sure.

19:13.320 --> 19:15.010
Mr. Shiki.

19:15.010 --> 19:16.930
I really like him.

19:16.930 --> 19:19.560
He's the perfect man in my eyes!

19:22.180 --> 19:23.310
Smells delicious.

19:23.310 --> 19:24.680
I think it's almost ready.

19:24.680 --> 19:25.980
Put some meat in it.

19:25.980 --> 19:29.010
- Is he married?
- And the vegetables, too.

19:29.010 --> 19:30.770
- But I wouldn't mind...
- Has anyone tasted this?

19:30.770 --> 19:34.860
- ...being his second or third wife.
- Nope.

19:37.670 --> 19:39.230
We're almost at the lake.

19:39.710 --> 19:43.290
Let's gather some herbs and give them
to Mr. Shiki and Mr. Kuzunoha as a gift.

19:43.290 --> 19:44.450
Great idea.

19:44.830 --> 19:46.920
Let's hurry up!

19:49.210 --> 19:50.000
Yuno?

19:50.000 --> 19:51.190
What's wrong?

19:53.630 --> 19:54.920
This is...

19:54.920 --> 19:56.170
A drake!

19:56.680 --> 19:58.590
Abelia, any info about this thing?

19:59.010 --> 20:00.890
It's a drake of the lowest category.

20:00.890 --> 20:02.640
It prefers operating alone.

20:02.640 --> 20:04.100
Ice is its weakness.

20:04.890 --> 20:09.600
It takes a team of ten fighters
above level 90 to take it down.

20:09.600 --> 20:11.480
But our levels are...

20:11.480 --> 20:13.980
LEVEL 75 ON AVERAGE

20:13.980 --> 20:15.820
I'll support from the rear.

20:16.320 --> 20:19.780
Izumo, use wind magic
to raise our moving speed.

20:25.120 --> 20:26.120
I can't move.

20:26.620 --> 20:28.210
A roar that stuns its enemies.

20:28.210 --> 20:29.420
The effect is so powerful!

20:33.380 --> 20:35.550
Oh no! We're going to get burnt!

20:36.840 --> 20:39.840
Orb, Zei-roo-noh, Ju-narm.

20:48.390 --> 20:49.560
Wh-Who was it?

20:50.770 --> 20:52.860
You look so small.

20:53.320 --> 20:54.820
I'm not small!

20:55.330 --> 20:57.280
How did she know
what I was thinking?

20:57.780 --> 21:01.240
PANICKING
Skinny. You're hopeless with this build.

21:01.820 --> 21:04.110
Big boobs won't be adored forever.

21:05.540 --> 21:06.410
All the best.

21:07.660 --> 21:09.790
Stay strong and live on,
accessory of the wife.

21:10.960 --> 21:13.250
Taking on this path
will make you a masochist.

21:13.250 --> 21:15.090
It's not too late to turn back now, kiddo.

21:16.410 --> 21:18.380
I gave you the wrong amount of change.

21:19.220 --> 21:21.830
The journey lasts until you go home.

21:22.720 --> 21:25.210
Also, a banana is not a snack.

21:36.190 --> 21:37.110
Sorry,

21:37.460 --> 21:41.250
but the best part of this camping trip
only starts after this.

21:41.250 --> 21:42.570
Let's try this again, gecko.

21:47.970 --> 21:48.910
Huh?

21:49.410 --> 21:50.620
She's gone.

21:51.870 --> 21:55.590
This is going to be
an unforgettable summer.

21:56.340 --> 21:59.840
The teacher's meddling
is sweeter than bananas.

21:59.840 --> 22:02.720
The students won't know.

23:35.020 --> 23:39.860
NEXT EPISODE: SUMMER OF GROWTH AND NEW SKILLS
"Night 11: Summer of Growth and New Skills."
